WEBVTT

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.724
It's embarrassing how influential
behaviorism was,

00:03:32.748 --> 00:03:34.079
but I'll get back to that.

00:03:34.103 --> 00:03:36.813
And four: Maybe consciousness exists,

00:03:36.837 --> 00:03:39.028
but it can't make
any difference to the world.

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.748
How could spirituality move anything?

00:03:41.772 --> 00:03:43.963
Now, whenever somebody
tells me that, I think,

00:03:43.987 --> 00:03:46.253
you want to see spirituality
move something?

00:03:46.277 --> 00:03:49.105
Watch. I decide consciously
to raise my arm,

00:03:49.129 --> 00:03:51.714
and the damn thing goes up. (Laughter)

00:03:51.738 --> 00:03:55.485
Furthermore, notice this:

00:03:55.509 --> 00:03:59.480
We do not say, "Well, it's a bit
like the weather in Geneva.

00:03:59.504 --> 00:04:02.128
Some days it goes up and some days
it doesn't go up."